  # Unified entry point for all API services.
  #
  # Takes an {Auth::Authenticator} and optionally {TransportOptions},
  # then exposes each API group as a typed property. If the authenticator
  # includes {Auth::HttpAwareAuthenticator}, the shared {ApiClient} is
  # injected so that authentication HTTP calls (token exchange, discovery)
  # use the same transport configuration as regular API calls.
